  m_text: "This often comes down to speeding through an intersection, missing a mirror
    check, or not accounting for the blind spots around the cab. Real trucks have
    huge blind zones where a person can disappear completely \u2014 a quick scan
    can be the difference between a safe turn and a fatal one."
